    "accessibility": {
      "short": "Diamond-shaped abstract painting with black grid lines and blocks of yellow, black, blue, and red on white.",
      "long": "A square canvas presented as a diamond, featuring a network of thick black horizontal and vertical lines that divide the white surface into irregular rectangles and squares. A large yellow triangle occupies the upper-left area; a black square sits to its right and slightly below; a blue right triangle fills the lower-right corner; and a small red square appears at the bottom-center where two black lines cross. The composition is balanced yet asymmetrical, with open white spaces throughout.",
